This page lists public opinion polls conducted for the [[2022 French presidential election]], of which the first round was held on 10 April 2022. Since no candidate won a majority of the vote in the first round, the second round election was held between the top two candidates on 24 April 2022.

== First round ==
=== Graphical summary ===
The following graphical summary represents the polling numbers of the following candidates:{{efn|The candidates are listed according to their rough position on the [[political spectrum]], beginning with [[Left-wing politics|left-wing]] candidate and ending with [[Right-wing politics|right-wing]] candidates.}}
* [[Nathalie Arthaud]] ([[Lutte Ouvrière]])
* [[Philippe Poutou]] ([[New Anticapitalist Party|Nouveau Parti anticapitaliste]])
* [[Fabien Roussel]] ([[French Communist Party|Parti communiste français]])
* [[Jean-Luc Mélenchon]] ([[La France Insoumise|La France insoumise]])
* [[Christiane Taubira]] ([[Miscellaneous left|divers gauche]], withdrawn)
* [[Anne Hidalgo]] ([[Socialist Party (France)|Parti socialiste]])
* [[Arnaud Montebourg]] ([[Miscellaneous left|divers gauche]], withdrawn)
* [[Yannick Jadot]] ([[Europe Ecology – The Greens|Europe Écologie Les Verts]])
* [[Emmanuel Macron]] ([[La République En Marche!|La République en Marche!]])
* [[Jean Lassalle]] ([[Jean_Lassalle#2017_presidential_campaign|Résistons!]])
* [[Valérie Pécresse]] ([[The Republicans (France)|Les Républicains]])
* [[Nicolas Dupont-Aignan]] ([[Debout la France]])
* [[Marine Le Pen]] ([[National Rally|Rassemblement national]])
* [[Éric Zemmour]] ([[Reconquête]])

